[[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the electrical connector (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Speaker in left rear door</p></td><td><p>P040</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Speaker in right rear door</p></td><td><p>P041</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2217.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<p>1. Connect the electrical connector for the rear side speaker.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Speaker in left rear door</p></td><td><p>P040</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Speaker in right rear door</p></td><td><p>P041</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Fit the rear side speaker (2a) in the housing and tighten the fixing bolts (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2218.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]